{"about_the_game":"<strong>Mython Island</strong> is a monster catching RPG featuring an <strong>Open Island Adventure</strong> mode and dedicated <strong>Survival</strong> Modes! Story based level scaling and difficulty settings allows you to build a team of Mython, grow stronger, and take on the game in the way you wish!<br><br><strong>Story or Survival!</strong><br>Embark on your Mython Island journey by selecting one of three different Mython and experience the Open Island Adventure or experience the prequel story and other survival modes including receiving a random team of Mython or choosing your team and run settings in Draft mode!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419070/extras/a2733046d03ac1baa4651ed8ac2cc894.poster.avif?t=1712903726\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419070/extras/a2733046d03ac1baa4651ed8ac2cc894.webm?t=1712903726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419070/extras/a2733046d03ac1baa4651ed8ac2cc894.mp4?t=1712903726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Explore an Open Island!</strong><br>Set out on your Island adventure and take on the story of this adventure featuring complete story based level scaling, difficulty options, and many Mython for you to discover! Complete your Mython Log, build a team from over 100 different Mython, and help out the King of the Island!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419070/extras/d389875dc98e363a20b8ccb4c81f8f72.avif?t=1712903726\" width=616 height=252 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419070/extras/c622128543cf744edc4952711571bae8.avif?t=1712903726\" width=616 height=252 /></span><br><br><strong>Select Your Path!</strong><br>Survival Game Modes offer generated paths for each run! Each path offers choices which allow you to select your way forward. Including fateful encounters, shopping for items, hidden power shrines, story related events and more! These generated choices for each path offer a unique gameplay experience for every playthrough! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419070/extras/4a85b819d99fe8bbff11585c10c849eb.avif?t=1712903726\" width=616 height=252 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Let's Get Started","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1419070/d0bc4aaff5d5d4ddd839a5afec3d4330f1a804d8.jpg"},{"name":"Awakening","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1419070/5f4adb75aa72152076fe2718a67f0241070eae5c.jpg"},{"name":"Hidden Treasure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1419070/a339ba59acc69f1a6dcd94174add12fc6b0bf4a7.jpg"},{"name":"Made of Muuluh","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1419070/5e41985e8c330f362e42c207f53352b0c7554a13.jpg"},{"name":"A Strong Bond","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1419070/ccab804a257e83df50ddbe1bda5e992c8012ceb3.jpg"},{"name":"Island Radiance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1419070/8295df140e0a7ae3b9565a0d719a30670a7e14fe.jpg"},{"name":"Important Notice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1419070/92b2da8049cd422a83b1e38da06e7bed9219243f.jpg"},{"name":"Evolutionary Power","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1419070/82be73054d2e769a053748e350dd5be0414c2e50.jpg"},{"name":"Island Competition","path":"https://cdn.akamai.stea